      "cooked": "<p>I have to made advance payment including GST.<br>\nBasic Value: 63,815.00<br>\nGST Value: 5,546.00(Including with 18% and 12% rate)<br>\nTDS : 69.361</p>\n<p>When i create payment entry with paid amount Basic value + GST Value = 69,361 and applied TDS with 0.1% rate it will take TDS value as given above 69.361</p>\n<p>But TDS must be apllied on Basic Value 63815 which will be 64.</p>\n<p>Currently i have made 2 entries</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>For Apply TDS on Basic<br>\nCreditors 63815 DR<br>\nBANK 63751 CR<br>\nTDS on Purchase of Goods 194Q 64 CR</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Payment entry for GST Amount<br>\nCreditors 5546 DR<br>\nBANK 5546 CR</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>If i add TDS manually and do below entry<br>\nCreditors 69,361 DR<br>\nBANK 69297 CR<br>\nTDS on Purchase of Goods 194Q 64 CR</p>\n<p>it will show wrong impact on the report “Tax Withholding Details”<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/6/862aa4f3f0f372afc4d2566b3cfa1afb1c728b1e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/862aa4f3f0f372afc4d2566b3cfa1afb1c728b1e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/6/862aa4f3f0f372afc4d2566b3cfa1afb1c728b1e_2_690x141.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"j8Tlsx8fFvi73Z7LUql7kDSBX9I\" width=\"690\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/6/862aa4f3f0f372afc4d2566b3cfa1afb1c728b1e_2_690x141.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/6/862aa4f3f0f372afc4d2566b3cfa1afb1c728b1e_2_1035x211.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/6/862aa4f3f0f372afc4d2566b3cfa1afb1c728b1e_2_1380x282.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1606×330 30.3 